       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-EDO22-PITCH.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-EDO22-PITCH-PROOFS.
           05  WS-EDO22-DIVISION-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PHASE-ALIGNMENT-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CARRIER-MODULATION-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PITCH-LATENCY-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-EDO22-SEAL-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-EDO22-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-EDO-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-EDO-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-DIV-AND-ALIGN.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-MOD-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-EDO-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-DIV-AND-ALIGN.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-EDO22-DIVISION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PHASE-ALIGNMENT-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-MOD-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CARRIER-MODULATION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PITCH-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-EDO-PROOFS.
           IF WS-EDO22-DIVISION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PHASE-ALIGNMENT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CARRIER-MODULATION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PITCH-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-EDO22-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-EDO-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-EDO-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-EDO-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-EDO-CODE.
